        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this a Game yet? (ItaGy) is an open invitation: you and me, building a game live, one update at a time. In the beginning there was exactly one button and a global leaderboard. No tutorials, no roadmaps. Every click, every idea, every vote shaped what the game is now and what it will be in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JOURNEY SO FAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the initial button in Cycle 0, the game changed to a twin button system with challenges, decoys and cursor upgrades in Cycle 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.poster.avif?t=1756813310\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.webm?t=1756813310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.mp4?t=1756813310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle 2 added a new rhythm challenge, dark mode and hub world overhaul while Cycle 3 completely changed the core gameplay to WASD controls, aquatic-themed graphics, a new swarm challenge and a multi-stage boss fight against MEGANOM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.poster.avif?t=1756813310\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.webm?t=1756813310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.mp4?t=1756813310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will Cycle 4 bring to the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW IT WORKS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blank Canvas Start</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button, one counter, zero instructions. Your clicks fill an empty leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-Driven Updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each cycle, the top 3 global scorers and top 2 most liked submissions will be chosen and implemented in the very next update cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Co-Development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All development happens live on stream. Jump into chat, suggest features on the fly, watch your ideas take shape in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today it’s a clicker, tomorrow a platformer, puzzle, RPG, or something entirely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY JUMP IN NOW?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paid Expansions. Purchase early and enjoy all future updates forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just playing, you’re designing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time feedback via development live streams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent update cycles mean the game never feels the same twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a tight-knit community where every vote matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, climb, design! Let's find out together if we can turn the answer to &quot;Is this a Game yet?&quot; from a <strong>No</strong> into a resounding <strong>Yes</strong>.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this a Game yet? (ItaGy) is an open invitation: you and me, building a game live, one update at a time. In the beginning there was exactly one button and a global leaderboard. No tutorials, no roadmaps. Every click, every idea, every vote shaped what the game is now and what it will be in the future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JOURNEY SO FAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the initial button in Cycle 0, the game changed to a twin button system with challenges, decoys and cursor upgrades in Cycle 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.poster.avif?t=1756813310\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.webm?t=1756813310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/c7f05cc0f4fb1b9041e698035c8aeeca.mp4?t=1756813310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cycle 2 added a new rhythm challenge, dark mode and hub world overhaul while Cycle 3 completely changed the core gameplay to WASD controls, aquatic-themed graphics, a new swarm challenge and a multi-stage boss fight against MEGANOM.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.poster.avif?t=1756813310\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.webm?t=1756813310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831220/extras/91d5a91baaa38aab5c9839aed5dfb4d1.mp4?t=1756813310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will Cycle 4 bring to the game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW IT WORKS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blank Canvas Start</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One button, one counter, zero instructions. Your clicks fill an empty leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player-Driven Updates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each cycle, the top 3 global scorers and top 2 most liked submissions will be chosen and implemented in the very next update cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live Co-Development</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All development happens live on stream. Jump into chat, suggest features on the fly, watch your ideas take shape in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Possibilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today it’s a clicker, tomorrow a platformer, puzzle, RPG, or something entirely new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHY JUMP IN NOW?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No paid Expansions. Purchase early and enjoy all future updates forever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re not just playing, you’re designing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time feedback via development live streams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frequent update cycles mean the game never feels the same twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a tight-knit community where every vote matters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY ACCESS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click, climb, design! Let's find out together if we can turn the answer to &quot;Is this a Game yet?&quot; from a <strong>No</strong> into a resounding <strong>Yes</strong>.</p>",
